From 26548670a169e78f27e6e43cd0f47fe610a6f512 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:41:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] r36 S4 flag F, friendly-chain guard (RELAY-117 live play-test
 71091): in Enhanced, when every open chain link is ours, the base pilot
 declined and a negating card is on offer, the decline is played without
 search (no own Ash on own Zero); Classic unchanged; regression test on
 ChatGPT's replay export (friendly + enemy control)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HYdavRJmQWYnZCPQsymeGW
